A guide walks with you the whole time. Expect sergeant majors, butterflyfish and the odd curious wrasse coming close enough to feed from your hand.

What to bring:
- Swimwear and a towel
- A change of clothes for the ride back
- Reef-safe sunscreen

The walk itself lasts about 25 minutes. The full activity, including briefing and the boat ride to the platform, takes 45 minutes.', 'diver-fish', '[{"path":"diver-fish","alt":"A diver surrounded by a school of yellow fish"},{"path":"reef-colour","alt":"Coral reef with small fish in clear blue water"},{"path":"fish-school","alt":"A school of silver fish in open water"},{"path":"reef-triggerfish","alt":"A titan triggerfish on the reef floor"},{"path":"reef-fish","alt":"Sergeant major fish over coral"}]'::jsonb, true, 'Undersea walk in Mauritius', 'Walk the lagoon floor in a surface-fed helmet. No swimming needed, ages 7 and up, 45 minutes with briefing.', 7, 'Not suitable during pregnancy or with a cold, sinus or ear infection. No swimming ability needed.', 'underwater');

Fly on your own or in tandem. Landings are back on the deck, so you only get wet if you ask the skipper for a dip on the way down.

What to bring:
- Clothes you do not mind getting splashed
- Sunglasses with a strap
- A camera or phone on a lanyard

Flights run in winds up to 20 knots. If the skipper postpones because of weather, we move you to the next slot or refund you in full.', 'parasail-turquoise', '[{"path":"parasail-turquoise","alt":"A parasail over turquoise water towed by a small boat"},{"path":"parasail-yacht","alt":"A parasail flying beside a white motor yacht"},{"path":"parasail-boat","alt":"A rainbow parasail above a speedboat"},{"path":"parasail-close","alt":"Two people in a tandem parasail harness"}]'::jsonb, true, 'Parasailing in Mauritius', 'Ten minutes in the air above the lagoon, solo or tandem, launched and landed from the boat deck. Ages 6 and up.', 6, 'Combined weight limits apply for tandem flights. Children fly in tandem with an adult.', 'air');

